# Wave T49 (Bridgeport kit): rivetroof — the RIVETED PALE IRON of the Bridgeport Gym, worn only by the shipped Gym stamp's tr roof cells, so the Gym + Library tr-roof share breaks and the town's unmarked gym hall (the Backstory-Sync-Audit's Bridgeport flag) is marked by its roof emblem: pale iron plate courses with rivet dots and a bold badge roundel at the centre — Doran's gym is 'all iron and certainty' (LIBRARIAN MIRA), and the town's bridge 'is also iron'. PALE iron with an emblem: the inverse register of Coalseam's dark soot-iron ironroof; no other fleet roof carries a roundel (Inglenook's domeroof is gold dome segments, Honeyfield's bloomroof petal scales, Heritage's heritageroof teal slate courses, Repose's oliveroof olive wood shingle, Shardfall's shardroof a checkerboard). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T49-BRIDGEPORT-PLAN.md §5.)
